### Registrar pagamento manual
POST {{base_url}}/api/admin/tenants/{{tenant_id}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "valor": 299.90,
  "tipo": "manual",
  "referencia": "PIX 2026-04",
  "observacao": "Pagamento mensal abril/2026",
  "data_pagamento": "2026-04-05"
}

### Listar pagamentos de um tenant
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/tenants/{{tenant_id}}/payments?page=1&per_page=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Alterar status de pagamento
PATCH {{base_url}}/api/admin/payments/{{payment_id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "pago"
}

### Consultar situação financeira do tenant
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/tenants/{{tenant_id}}/financial-status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
